<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian federal forces have installed a caretaker administration in Tigray and a pro-government militia says it seized the regional airport, while Eritrean forces suffered losses there. The United States, through Secretary of State Marco Rubio, is urging Ethiopia and Eritrea to de-escalate the fighting, and Mekelle mayor Shishay Amare announced elections within six months to resolve Western Tigray through constitutional processes. A drone strike in the disputed Abyei region killed at least 73 people. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPcTJMaFBua2FpcHRaaE5TVkZKM29mVGpyVDR6cFJsclN5WFJYNFpQU2EwSWprNkJoYUJ5U0I3NElFM2tBdzBiTGVrOTRuZ19kOVVQeG1fcl9RSHIxTFplYWc2MnFsMmxVWWM2SHdHdjFFUnNJZDJQV0dyY1dhUURIWnFEMzJVWEZtU1JoSVNVTEZxYlVKNWhFaXZCTXUweVpOcnJ5cGp1Vjc0SXE2S2l0a1Zla1NkdTQy0gG-AUFVX3lxTE1RUFdsVUFQcUVWZlMyM18ySlNZR3dWVExOc05LTFVpWDhWNnh6ZWx6cFdFRGtJQ0ttT2V5NXgzR0dwSWZWQ25HV1dkdEpJUnQzeGFQTEs4UFVPTi15bjVUOFhKaldMVjhtVjBYcXdSdEdLN1FGSUNTUURsdHlUVW5zNVRNTVJKOHpzbnNTbmgxTzRTZ2tSRXItbzJWTkxMNENrY2F0ZUEtSnlxbS0tU05ZOHFBWTVuRkI3Wk1Pb2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxObHY2VWZCbHRoM2ZNTWxCa3ZoN1RHS0VWaWVsUWhFSU1SbDVKTnZxcnZOQVZKYUc3dXNKQjhsaVN5NDVRV21GanRkN1ZvWl9KeDY0bUd0US0tV1h3aXFILXJNR09OZTVRQ2lobkZDVDJsbnhjMTgwdkg1aENnWkhJUTZGRUtlQlZxYkc0RXNjUkxGRUdrb3A2ZFA3RDB5eDMyTU5WSWtYVjlZMzJpLVVLSkpkaGtxOWhyZ3JlOE5tZk55OXlsWWxOWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastleigh Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE8yNkh5eHMzVnhfRkFid1FSUnllREhZRGMzUEc0NkdFTTYxYmNzRjREeDFuRjdySHp1bzFUMENGM25EbHRMTEZ4cjJ3ZnVSdlU2TlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&